---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | CalcPath"
  description="CalcPath affiliate disclosure. We earn commissions from some links on this site. This helps us keep the tools free."
>
  <div class="max-w-[768px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-8">Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">How CalcPath Makes Money</h2>
        <p>
          CalcPath earns commissions from some links on this site. When you click an affiliate link
          and sign up for a financial product, we may receive a referral fee. This helps us keep all
          our calculators and tools free.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">What This Means for You</h2>
        <p>
          You pay nothing extra. The products cost the same whether you use our link or go directly
          to the provider. Affiliate relationships never add fees or change the terms of any product.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">How We Choose Recommendations</h2>
        <p>
          We only recommend products we've researched. Affiliate relationships do not influence our
          calculator results — the math is the math. When we feature a financial product, it's
          because we believe it could genuinely help users of that particular calculator.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Not every calculator page has affiliate recommendations. Where there's no natural product
          fit, we don't force one.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Our Affiliate Partners</h2>
        <p>CalcPath currently has or intends to establish affiliate relationships with:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-3 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Betterment</strong> — Investment and retirement accounts, high-yield savings
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Marcus by Goldman Sachs</strong> — High-yield savings accounts
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Wealthfront</strong> — Automated investing and financial planning
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>SoFi</strong> — Student loan refinancing, personal loans, investing
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>LendingTree</strong> — Mortgage comparison and loan marketplace
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>LendingClub</strong> — Personal loans and debt consolidation
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ally</strong> — High-yield savings accounts and banking
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Vanguard</strong> — Retirement accounts and index funds
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>1Password</strong> — Password management
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>NordPass</strong> — Password management
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-500">
          This list is updated as new partnerships are established. Not all listed programs
          may be active at any given time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Not Financial Advice</h2>
        <p>
          CalcPath provides educational tools and information, not personalized financial advice. The
          presence of affiliate links does not constitute a recommendation for your specific
          situation. Consult a qualified financial advisor for decisions specific to your circumstances.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
